OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety plans to be reviewed
OL,4,Aafter cow death
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinchinhampton parish councillor,
OL,7,FPhilippa Schwartz, has been calling for
OL,8,Fa reduced speed limit for more than a
OL,9,Fdecade. She said she is not convinced
OL,10,FGPS technology is advanced enough yet,
OL,11,Fbut would welcome anything that
OL,12,Fprotects livestock.
OL,14,FGloucestershire County Council (GCC)
OL,15,Fcabinet member for transport and road
OL,16,Fsafety, Roger Whyborn, said the
OL,17,Fproposals will be reviewed by the
OL,18,Fsafety group next month.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
